ription\">Edit anything, anytime. Your AI-designed site is fully customizable without coding knowledge required.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"component_social_proof_6\" class=\"section section--social-proof\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"stat-highlight\">\n      <div class=\"stat-highlight__number\">5,000+</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-highlight__label\">Websites Launched | 94% Satisfaction Rate | 2.5x Faster Than Traditional Design</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"testimonials grid grid--3\">\n      <div class=\"testimonial card\">\n        <div class=\"testimonial__rating\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"testimonial__text\">\"We went from concept to live website in 48 hours. What would have taken months and cost thousands was delivered in days at a fraction of the price.\"</p>\n        <p class=\"testimonial__author\">[Future You] - Delighted Business Owner</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"testimonial card\">\n        <div class=\"testimonial__rating\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"testimonial__text\">\"The AI understood our industry better than any designer we've worked with. Our conversion rate increased by 34% in the first month.\"</p>\n        <p class=\"testimonial__author\">[Soon to be Delighted Customer] - Pleased Marketing Director</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"testimonial card\">\n        <div class=\"testimonial__rating\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"testimonial__text\">\"Finally, a web design solution that's fast, affordable, and actually works. This is the future of web design.\"</p>\n        <p class=\"testimonial__author\">[Happy Customer] - Thrilled Entrepreneur</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"commit_message":"MVP v1: Initial site build for website-design.com"}}

